                <pb facs="0856" n="720" sameAs="frus:frus1929v01/pg720"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">723.2515/3235a: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Ambassador in Peru</hi>
                        (<hi rendition="#italic">Moore</hi>)</head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Paraphrase]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1928-12-01T16:00:00-05:00">December 1, 1928—4
                        p.m.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p>84. Have you had an interview with President Leguia relating to a settlement of
                    the Tacna-Arica matter along the lines you were talking to me, and with what
                    result? Please make a full report.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Kellogg</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
